{"availability":"available","full":"thisisdajaaa/dota-den","name":"dota-den","description":"Dota 2 companion: honest match and MMR tracking, Captain's Mode draft practice against an AI captain, live pro games with draft analysis, and hero meta. Next.js 16, TypeScript, MongoDB, OpenDota.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-29T15:27:20Z","updated":"2026-10-08T21:30:25Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://dota-den.vercel.app","topics":["dota-2","dota2","draft-simulator","esports","mmr-tracker","modular-monolith","mongodb","nextjs","opendota","react","shadcn-ui","tailwindcss","typescript","upstash","vercel"],"demo":"https://dota-den.vercel.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:11.391Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:11.391Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:11.391Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T23:43:11.391Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A Dota 2 companion for players who want honest answers about their own games, and a place to practise drafting that feels like a real captain across the table.","Production · Staging · Docs · Roadmap · Changelog · Decisions (ADRs)"],"features":["Steam sign-in. OpenID with rotating, server-side sessions (ADR 0001).","Auto-synced match history. Imports your public matches (first sync backfills, later syncs are incremental), with","in-app match pages: scoreboard, gold and XP graphs, items, and every player's rank where known.","MMR journal. Log your MMR when you see it. A change is shown as exact only when two entries bracket exactly the","ranked games in between; otherwise it's labelled an estimate with the reason (ADR 0007). Climb by hero shows each hero's record and estimated climb game by game, exact only when your entries isolate games on that one…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/thisisdajaaa/dota-den/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"c8100c9ef380996e114e039d4